r pressure , over either liquid water or ice.\n The function can also return the derivatives , , or through an optional argument.\n The module does not depend on ESMF and its only dependence\n on the rest of MAPL is for the definition\n of gas constants. If the preprocessor macro 1 is not defined,\n these are assigned standard values and the build becomes\n independent of the rest of MAPL. File Used The main computations are done in the following include files: eqsat.H esatlqu.H esatice.H qsatlqu.H qsatice.H. @note Bug\n     The tables and some control parameters are globals.\n     This can result in unsafe race conditions when called from\n     multiple threads. Most of these, however, will be benign. Uses iso_fortran_env MAPL_Constants module~~mapl_satvapor_mod~~UsesGraph module~mapl_satvapor_mod mapl_SatVapor_mod iso_fortran_env iso_fortran_env module~mapl_satvapor_mod->iso_fortran_env module~mapl_constants MAPL_Constants module~mapl_satvapor_mod->module~mapl_constants module~mapl_earthatmosphericconstants_mod mapl_EarthAtmosphericConstants_mod module~mapl_constants->module~mapl_earthatmosphericconstants_mod module~mapl_earthconstants_mod mapl_EarthConstants_mod module~mapl_constants->module~mapl_earthconstants_mod module~mapl_internalconstants_mod mapl_InternalConstants_mod module~mapl_constants->module~mapl_internalconstants_mod module~mapl_mathconstants_mod mapl_MathConstants_mod module~mapl_constants->module~mapl_mathconstants_mod module~mapl_physicalconstants_mod mapl_PhysicalConstants_mod module~mapl_constants->module~mapl_physicalconstants_mod module~mapl_earthatmosphericconstants_mod->module~mapl_physicalconstants_mod module~mapl_earthconstants_mod->iso_fortran_env module~mapl_earthconstants_mod->module~mapl_mathconstants_mod module~mapl_internalconstants_mod->iso_fortran_env module~mapl_mathconstants_mod->iso_fortran_env Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Module Module Submodule Submodule Subroutine Subroutine Fu